<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian reserves rise by $193.7 million in May.</title>
<headline>Slovenian reserves rise by $193.7 million in May.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Monday:</p>
<p>FOREIGN EXCHANGE RESERVES</p>
<p>    (in millions of dollars)	   May	April     May 96</p>
<p>    Total reserves		   4,068.3    3,874.6     3,356.1</p>
<p>    Central bank reserves	  2,681.9    2,475.9     1,498.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Total reserves are those held by the banking sector as whole. -- Ljubljana newsroom,386-61-125-843</p>
</text>
